title: metarecord:trash
tags: [[GUI command]] Trash
kind: reference
summary: Send the selected metarecord's file to the trash

Sends the file of the workspace's selected metarecord to the trash, its
metarecords with it — what `mf trash -f` does — after a confirmation, since it
hangs off a key. Nothing is forced: a reference from another metarecord is a
refusal, shown on the status bar. See [[Sending files to the trash]].
